  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Coastal Luxury & Comfort:<br><br>Designed with a light and breezy coastal feel, Salt and Sarah is meticulously decorated and furnished with a blend of comfort and elegance. From spacious living areas to thoughtfully designed bedrooms, every detail has been chosen to create an unforgettable stay.<br><br>Layout & Sleeping Arrangements:<br><br>First Floor:<br>\t•\tOpen-concept kitchen with a large island (seating for 4), stainless steel appliances, and everything you need for entertaining. <br>\t•\tDining area with a table seating 6.<br>\t•\tSpacious, airy living room with a large smart TV.<br>\t•\tPrimary King Suite with a luxurious ensuite bathroom and a large walk-in closet.<br>\t•\tGuest powder room for added convenience.<br>\t•\tAttached one car garage with 6 seater golf cart for complimentary guest use.<br><br>Second Floor:<br>\t•\tCozy sitting area with balcony access—perfect for morning coffee or evening relaxation.<br>\t•\tQueen bedroom with ensuite bathroom.<br>\t•\tKing bedroom with ensuite bathroom.<br>\t•\tBunk room perfect for kids, featuring 2 sets of double bunks plus a trundle bed.<br>\t•\tFifth bedroom with 2 twin beds and access to a full bathroom.<br><br>Outdoor Living:<br>\t•\tFront porch, patio and balconies for outdoor enjoyment.<br>\t•\tOne-car garage and well-maintained landscaping and a 6 Seater Golf Cart<br>\t•\tCommunity amenities include a neighborhood pool just steps away.<br> <br><br>Why You'll Love It:<br>Salt and Sarah combines modern coastal design with high-end finishes, ensuring both style and comfort. Whether you're enjoying time together in the open-concept living area, lounging on the balcony, or heading out for a beach day, this home is designed to be the perfect Inlet Beach getaway.<br><br>Local Attractions Near Salt & Sarah:<br><br>Beaches & Coastal Access:<br>\t•\tInlet Beach – Just minutes away, this wide stretch of sugar-white sand and emerald water is ideal for swimming, shelling, sunbathing, and sunset walks. Multiple boardwalks make access easy and scenic.<br>30A Scenic Corridor<br>\t•\tA short drive brings you to the iconic towns of 30A, each offering their own unique charm with boutique shopping, art, events, and coastal architecture.<br><br>Lakes & Outdoor Adventures:<br>\t•\tCoastal Dune Lakes – Rare and beautiful, these natural wonders are perfect for kayaking, paddleboarding, and fishing. Their mix of fresh and saltwater creates a peaceful environment for both wildlife watching and family recreation.<br><br>\t•\tNearby Coastal Parks – Local state parks and preserves provide hiking trails, picnic areas, birdwatching, and natural dune ecosystems to explore.<br>Recreation & Relaxation.<br><br>\t•\tCommunity Pool – Steps from the home, the neighborhood pool is perfect for relaxing days without leaving the property.<br><br>\t•\tGolf & Outdoor Activities – Several nearby golf courses and biking trails make it easy to stay active while enjoying the natural coastal surroundings.<br><br>Charming Nearby Towns:<br>\t•\tRosemary Beach, Seacrest, and Seaside – Within minutes you'll find beautiful streetscapes, boutique shopping, art galleries, and lively coastal squares, each with a distinct character that reflects the best of the Emerald Coast lifestyle.<br><br>Inlet Beach Favorites:<br>\t•\tCuvee 30A – Located in the 30Avenue complex, this eatery serves elevated coastal dishes like pecan-crusted grouper paired with world-class wines and features lively ambiance with live music <br>\t•\tAmici 30A Italian Kitchen – A warm, family-friendly spot offering fresh-made Italian fare, including Neapolitan pizzas, pastas, and a welcoming.<br>\t•\tAmigos 30A Mexican Kitchen – Right next door to Amici, it's known for generous portions, flavorful Mexican cuisine, and a fun happy hour atmosphere.<br>\t•\tShaka Sushi & Cocktail Bar – A cool, relaxed spot serving sushi, sashimi, and creative cocktails in a clean, earthy setting..<br>\t•\tShades Bar & Grill – A long-standing family favorite with classic casual fare like wings, grilled fish, and a wide draft beer selection—perfect for relaxed, flavorful dining.<br>\t•\tIHP (Idyll Hound Proper) – Recently voted the “Hottest New Restaurant” in 2023, offering a trendy vibe and modern influences.<br><br>Popular Dining Along 30A:<br>Explore a variety of unique culinary experiences in the surrounding towns along Highway 30A:<br>\t•\tO-Ku (Alys Beach) – Stylish Japanese cuisine featuring sushi and sashimi in a modern, minimalist setting at the heart of Alys Beach.<br>\t•\tHavana Beach Bar & Grill (Rosemary Beach) – Inspired by Hemingway's favorite Cuban hangout, it offers coastal Americana with Caribbean accents and a vibrant, communal atmosphere.<br>\t•\tRestaurant Paradis (Rosemary Beach) – Upscale dining with a focus on seasonal, fresh ingredients and fine Gulf seafood—ideal for elegant evenings.<br>\t•\tAmbrosia Prime Seafood & Steaks – Located in Watersound Town Center, this is a go-to for fresh Gulf-to-table seafood and luxurious steak options.<br>\t•\tSeagrove Village Market Café (Seagrove Beach) – A casual, historic spot famous for its grouper sandwich, a local must-try.<br>\t•\tPescado Seafood Grill & Rooftop Bar (Rosemary Beach) – Known for shareable seafood platters and a scenic rooftop bar—perfect for meals with a view.<br>\t•\tThe Citizen & George's (Alys Beach) – Upscale but relaxed venues in Alys Beach offering refined coastal and Southern-inspired fare in beautiful settings.<br>\t•\tAirstream Row Food Trucks (Seaside) – A nostalgic and vibrant cluster offering everything from crepes and grilled cheeses to smoked BBQ and shaved ice—great for casual, eclectic bites.<br>\t•\tOld Florida Fish House (Santa Rosa / Seagrove area) – Known for fresh, hearty seafood and lively gatherings—perfect for those who love music and waterfront vibes.<br>\t•\tBasmati's (Blue Mountain Beach) – Tucked away and beloved for its Asian-inspired cuisine and romantic ambiance, this hidden gem is well worth seeking out.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
